      "message": "fix(ui): workholding lives under Fixtures in every state\n\nThe Setups page showed the workholding block and tool list with no\nsetups, and neither the Setups nor the Setup<n> page showed it once a\nsetup existed. Workholding is now edited under Fixtures only: the\nSetups page drops the block and tool list with or without setups, and\na Setup<n> page gets an \"Open <name> fixtures\" button on its Delete line.\n\nRefs #1197\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
