      "message": "test(ui): click the Setup<n> Fixtures button in the one-setup test\n\nThe one-setup declutter test only asserted the \"Open <name> fixtures\"\nbutton existed, because it sat below the fold of the default pane. The\nharness pane is now taller and the test clicks the button and checks the\nFixtures page opens with the workholding.\n\nFixes #1197\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
