        "date": "2026-11-12T14:15:57Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): the Setup<n> Fixtures button activates its setup first\n\nThe button called only actions::target, so from an inactive setup it\nopened a Fixtures page that refused edits (\"not the active setup\") and\nshowed no workholding. It now calls browser_pane::focus before target,\nas the browser's Fixtures row and the Setups page's Open page button do.\n\nAlso: the Setups page and the implicit Settings page share one pointer\nline (setup_pages::WORKHOLDING_POINTER), and the decision note names\neffort:high and the right pinning test.\n\nFixes #1197\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
